<title>JAPAN: Daiwa House - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Daiwa House - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		570.24		vs	  500.69</p>
<p> Operating	   33.65		vs	   32.14</p>
<p> Current	     35.23		vs	   33.31</p>
<p> Net		   18.29		vs	   15.51</p>
<p> EPS		   36.22 yen	  vs	   32.41 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     511 million	 vs	  479 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Daiwa House Industry Co Ltd is a builder of steelframe homes.</p>
</text>
